WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.515
Step 1. Open the template panel.

1.2
00:00:02.515 --> 00:00:07.186
A saved template fills in medications or service requests for you.

1.3
00:00:07.186 --> 00:00:12.782
In the Medication Request or Service Request question, select Templates.

2.1
00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:17.110
Step 2. Find the template. Enter a name in Search templates.

2.2
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:21.799
The list shows the templates of this questionnaire, in this facility,

2.3
00:00:21.799 --> 00:00:23.454
that you can see.

3.1
00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:28.988
Step 3. Look at the items in the template. Select the template to expand it,

3.2
00:00:28.988 --> 00:00:33.312
and Care lists its medications or its service requests.

4.1
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:36.588
Step 4. Apply the template. Select Apply.

4.2
00:00:36.588 --> 00:00:42.418
Care adds all the items of the template to the end of the list in the question,

4.3
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:44.542
then closes the panel.

5.1
00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:50.443
Step 5. Review the added items. Applying a template saves nothing by itself.

5.2
00:00:50.443 --> 00:00:56.818
Check each item for this patient, and change or remove items before you submit.
